{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/420772-contract-of-the-jedi","id":420772,"title":"Contract of the Jedi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-26T16:14:09-08:00","id":420772,"title":"Contract of the Jedi","content":"An idea I had today. Changelings can, in principle, make bargains with almost anything, including concepts and abstractions, and there's no way to argue that the Jedi are not a well-known concept. So if a changeling who's also a Star Wars fan decides to create the Contract of the Jedi, what might it include? So far, I've come up with this:<br /> <br /> Use the Force, Luke (\u2022)<br /> Make an extended Meditation roll, add the result to your next action that isn't meditation. Maximum bonus is your unmodified dice pool total for that action.<br /> <br /> Healing Touch (\u2022\u2022)<br /> Probably use the same mechanics as Spring's healing clause<br /> <br /> For Knowlede and Defence (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> The changeling can deflect ranged attacks, given something with which to deflect them. Add Wyrd to defence against ranged attacks that normally allow defence, allow defence against ranged attacks that normally allow none<br /> <br /> A Strong Influence (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> The far-famed Jedi mind trick. No idea about the mechanics<br /> <br /> A Powerful Ally (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Telekinesis, not much in the way of mechanics yet.<br /> <br /> Thoughts and feedback requested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T18:10:24-08:00","id":420936,"title":"","content":"Well first of all, it really out to the be the contract of the Force, not Jedi, changelings make contracts with cosmic forces, not organizations. <br /> <br /> While I know that healing is one of the many, many powers that force users can do, it's hardly iconic. Clairsentience is, so I'd replace healing with a power to negate negative modifiers to perception rolls and the occasional ability to sense something ala omen sensitivity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T18:33:44-08:00","id":420954,"title":"","content":"The changing to clairvoyance works. I'm not sure about the Contract of the Force vs. the Contract of the Jedi, considering that the latter would imply the possibility of a Contract of the Sith, which fits with the very different uses to which Darksiders put their mastery of the Force.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T19:44:19-08:00","id":421050,"title":"","content":"Hmmm, well The Force is, as I understand it, the collective energy of the entire universe. I can see the possibility of mental and emotional based powers if you consider that all beings are connected through it. Wouldn't be hard to imagine reaching out through those connections to manipulate them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 02-26-2015, 10:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T20:09:01-08:00","id":421095,"title":"","content":"If you want sith based contracts, those would be contracts of the dark side of the force, or contracts of the dark side if you wanted to shorten it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T17:53:33-08:00","id":422369,"title":"","content":"Thematically, I'd rearrange the abilities a bit. Force Healing should be much rarer than basic Pulls and Pushes.<br /> <br /> I'd go:<br /> \u2022 Use the Force<br /> \u2022\u2022 For Knowledge and Defense<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Force Push/Pull/ Telekinesis<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022Mind Trick<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Force Healing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2283-andreamus","name":"andreamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2283_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T11:36:24-08:00","id":426747,"title":"","content":"A revised version, though still quite bare-bones<br /> <br /> Act On Instinct (\u2022)<br /> Make an extended Meditation roll, add the result to your next action that isn't meditation. Maximum bonus is your unmodified dice pool total for that action.<br /> <br /> Things You Will See (\u2022\u2022)<br /> Clairvoyance. Mechanics still under development.<br /> <br /> For Knowledge and Defence (\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> The changeling can deflect ranged attacks, given something with which to deflect them. Add Wyrd to defence against ranged attacks that normally allow defence, allow defence against ranged attacks that normally allow none<br /> <br /> A Strong Influence (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> The far-famed Jedi mind trick. No idea about the mechanics<br /> <br /> A Powerful Ally (\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022)<br /> Telekinesis, not much in the way of mechanics yet.<br /> <br /> Again, suggestions and feedback sought","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}